{"id":"c13","kind":"numeric","text":"html-js-filter 에서 low 시도 하나는 약 2분, high-effort 실행 하나는 약 33분 걸렸다 (장 3, 장 5, 장 10)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Higher effort levels help when there are many edge cases","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§How effort levels impact output","quote":"A typical attempt at low effort takes about 2 minutes. Each of these attempts wrote a filter in roughly one pass, then tested it against a single hand-written page."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§How effort levels impact output","quote":"A high-effort run finishes in about 33 minutes. In the run I traced, it adversarially reviewed its first draft, then read the installed parser’s source to check for bugs"}]}
