{"id":"c15","kind":"web","text":"Claude Code 에서 Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Haiku 5.5 의 기본 단계는 medium, Opus 4.7 은 xhigh, 그 밖의 모델은 high 다 (장 3, 장 12)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Adjust effort level 의 해석 순서 3번","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Adjust effort level","quote":"3. The model's default effort: `high` on every model that supports effort, except that Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, and Haiku 5.5 default to `medium`, Opus 4.7 defaults to `xhigh`"}]}
{"id":"c16","kind":"web","text":"effort 는 정해진 토큰 상한으로 작동하지 않고, 낮은 단계에서도 충분히 어려운 문제에는 생각한다 (장 2, 장 4)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w3 §Effort levels","evidence":[{"source":"w3","locator":"§Effort levels","quote":"Effort is a behavioral signal, not a strict token budget. At lower effort levels, Claude still thinks on sufficiently difficult problems, but thinks less than it would at higher effort levels for the same problem."}]}
{"id":"c17","kind":"web","text":"effort 는 모든 출력 토큰에 걸려 thinking 이 없어도 작동하고, 낮은 단계에서는 tool call 이 적고 짧아진다 (장 4)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w3 §How effort works","evidence":[{"source":"w3","locator":"§How effort works","quote":"Because effort applies to every output token, it works with or without thinking. Lower effort also means fewer and terser tool calls."}]}
{"id":"c18","kind":"web","text":"Claude Code 문서는 effort 가 adaptive reasoning 을 조절해 모델이 단계마다 생각할지와 얼마나 생각할지를 정한다고 설명한다 (장 4)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Adjust effort level","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Adjust effort level","quote":"control adaptive reasoning, which lets the model decide whether and how much to think on each step based on task complexity."}]}
{"id":"c19","kind":"web","text":"Opus 5.5 와 Fable 계열은 thinking 을 끌 수 없고 effort 가 그 양을 정한다 (장 4)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Extended thinking","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Extended thinking","quote":"You can't turn thinking off on Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Haiku 5.5, or the Fable models."},{"source":"w2","locator":"§Extended thinking","quote":"On these models, the model decides per step how much to think based on the effort level."}]}
{"id":"c20","kind":"web","text":"글쓴이는 effort 를 12시간과 1시간이라는 시간 약속에 빗대고, 높은 단계에서는 판단과 검증을 위해 혼자 움직이는 일이 는다고 설명한다 (장 4)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §What is effort?","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§What is effort?","quote":"Claude will always try and do your task reasonably, but higher effort will involve Claude taking more independent action for judgement and verification."}]}
