{"id":"c23","kind":"numeric","text":"mvcc-lsm-compaction: Opus 5.5 low 0/5, xhigh 4/5. low 는 약 1분, xhigh 는 약 11분 (장 5, 장 10)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §mvcc-lsm-compaction","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§mvcc-lsm-compaction","quote":"At low (about a minute per attempt), Claude would edit the code before building it or running the reproducer, and did not check that its new test would have caught the original bug."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§mvcc-lsm-compaction","quote":"At xhigh (about 11 minutes), Claude reproduced the crash first, wrote a randomized test against a reference that never compacts, and checked that its tests failed on half-finished fixes."}]}
