{"id":"c36","kind":"numeric","text":"/config 재설계는 low 1분, max 28분. 인터뷰 명세로 만든 앱은 low 16분, medium 22분, high 33분, max 79분이고 결과가 서로 비슷했다 (장 9)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Building with effort. 명세 빌드는 여러 모델로 돌렸다고 원문이 쓴다","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Building with effort","quote":"At low effort (which took 1 minute), I got an interactive sketch that conveyed the idea but didn’t look very much like Claude Code."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Building with effort","quote":"At max effort (which took 28 minutes), I got a mockup that looked very much like Claude Code, along with a bunch of walkthroughs for different flows."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Building with effort","quote":"I found that given this spec, the models behaved much more similarly. I got designs that looked fairly similar and had similar implementations but with different details"}]}
{"id":"c37","kind":"web","text":"Claude Code 는 작업 중에 /effort 를 받고, cache 경고가 뜨면 확인한 뒤 그 턴의 다음 요청부터 새 단계를 쓴다 (장 12)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Set the effort level","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Set the effort level","quote":"You can run it while Claude is working, and once you confirm the [cache warning](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/prompt-caching.md#changing-effort-level), if Claude Code shows one, Claude Code applies the new level to the next request in the turn"}]}
{"id":"c38","kind":"web","text":"글쓴이는 높은 단계가 일을 더 해 주지만 사용자 대신 더 많이 가정한다고 정리하고, 단계는 얼마나 곁에서 이끌지에 달렸다고 쓴다 (장 9)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Takeaways","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Takeaways","quote":"Low effort allows Claude to respond quickly with a starting point, higher effort levels will get more work done but Claude will also make more assumptions on my behalf."}]}
{"id":"c39","kind":"web","text":"Claude Code 문서는 max 가 수확 체감을 보이고 지나치게 생각하기 쉬우니 넓게 쓰기 전에 시험하라고 한다 (장 10)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Choose an effort level 의 max 행","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Choose an effort level","quote":"| `max` | Hard problems you want Claude to work through without you, such as finding security vulnerabilities. `max` may show diminishing returns and is prone to overthinking, so test before adopting it broadly |"}]}
{"id":"c40","kind":"web","text":"xhigh 는 Claude Code 문서에서 토큰을 더 쓰는 깊은 추론이고, API 문서는 30분 넘게 도는 agent 와 coding 작업을 예로 든다 (장 10)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Choose an effort level, w3 §Effort levels","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Choose an effort level","quote":"| `xhigh` | Deeper reasoning at higher token spend. The default on Opus 4.7 |"},{"source":"w3","locator":"§Effort levels","quote":"Long-running agentic and coding tasks (over 30 minutes) with token budgets in the millions"}]}
{"id":"c41","kind":"web","text":"문서의 low 예시는 이름 바꾸기 같은 작은 변경이다 (장 10, 장 11)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Choose an effort level 의 low 행","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Choose an effort level","quote":"| `low` | Quick exchanges where you review each result, such as brainstorming, a first sketch, or a small change like a rename |"}]}
{"id":"c42","kind":"numeric","text":"Fable 5.1 의 분야 규칙을 틀린 실패는 32건에서 24건이다 (장 7, 장 11)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 FIG B, Fable 5.1 low 와 max","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"FIG B","quote":"got the domain rule wrong32 → 24picked the wrong reading25 → 47"}]}
{"id":"c43","kind":"web","text":"글쓴이는 Terminal-Bench 3.0 과제가 보통의 업무보다 훨씬 복잡하다고 쓴다 (장 11)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §How effort levels impact output on difficult tasks","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§How effort levels impact output","quote":"I found I was surprised by the scope and ambition of a lot of these tasks. They are much more complicated than the average task I’d face."}]}
{"id":"c44","kind":"web","text":"/effort 뒤에 단계를 적거나 Enter 를 누르면 기본값으로 저장되고, s 를 누르면 이번 세션에만 적용된다(v2.1.257 이상) (장 12)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Adjust effort level","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Adjust effort level","quote":"* `Enter` in the `/effort` slider or the `/model` picker, or a level typed after `/effort`: save the level as your default and apply it in later sessions"},{"source":"w2","locator":"§Adjust effort level","quote":"* `s` in the `/effort` slider or the `/model` picker: apply the level to this session only. Requires Claude Code v2.1.257 or later"}]}
{"id":"c45","kind":"web","text":"max 는 CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL 로 정하지 않으면 이번 세션에만 적용되고, settings 의 effort 키는 max 를 받지 않는다 (장 12)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Adjust effort level, §Set the effort level","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Adjust effort level","quote":"`max` is the deepest reasoning level. Unless you set it through the `CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL` environment variable, Claude Code applies `max` to the current session only."},{"source":"w2","locator":"§Set the effort level","quote":"`max` isn't accepted as a level in either key, and `ultracode` has its own"}]}
{"id":"c46","kind":"web","text":"같은 단계 이름도 모델마다 실제 값이 다르고, Opus 5 에서 Opus 5.5 로 옮길 때는 medium 에서 시작하라고 문서가 권한다. coding 과 지식 업무 평가에서 Opus 5.5 medium 이 Opus 5 high 와 같거나 나았다 (장 12)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Choose an effort level","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Choose an effort level","quote":"The effort scale is calibrated per model, so the same level name does not represent the same underlying value across models."},{"source":"w2","locator":"§Choose an effort level","quote":"In Anthropic's testing, Opus 5.5 at `medium` matches or exceeds Opus 5 at `high` on coding and knowledge-work evaluations."}]}
{"id":"c47","kind":"web","text":"ultrathink 는 그 턴만 더 깊이 생각하라는 지시를 붙이고 API 로 보내는 effort 는 그대로다. skill 과 subagent frontmatter 의 effort 는 세션 단계를 덮지만 환경 변수는 덮지 못한다 (장 12)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Use ultrathink, §Set the effort level","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Use ultrathink","quote":"Claude Code recognizes the keyword and adds an in-context instruction. The effort level sent to the API is unchanged."},{"source":"w2","locator":"§Set the effort level","quote":"Frontmatter effort applies when that skill or subagent is active, overriding the session level but not the environment variable."}]}
{"id":"c48","kind":"web","text":"API 문서는 Fable 5.1, Opus 5.5, Opus 5 같은 모델은 메시지 단위로 단계를 바꿔 cache 를 지키고, 다른 모델은 cache 를 새로 시작한다고 설명한다 (장 12)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w3 §Change effort mid-conversation (beta)","evidence":[{"source":"w3","locator":"§Change effort mid-conversation","quote":"On Claude Fable 5.1, Claude Mythos 5.1, Claude Opus 5.5, Claude Opus 5, Claude Sonnet 5.5, and Claude Haiku 5.5, use a per-message effort change, which keeps the prompt cache."}]}
{"id":"c49","kind":"numeric","text":"실패 종류 데이터에서 Fable 5.1 은 xhigh 217번, max 214번 통과했고 곡선 그림은 Fable 5.1 xhigh 약 54.0%, max 58.0% 로 max 를 위에 그린다 (장 10, 장 13)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"FIG B 차트 데이터와 FIG A. 두 그림의 기준은 원문이 설명하지 않는다","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"FIG B data","quote":"FIG B data | Fable 5.1 | effort 80 | label xhigh | passed 217 of 370 | median 177400 tokens | missed a case 20 | made the wrong call 107 | picked the wrong reading 40"},{"source":"w1","locator":"FIG A point","quote":"FIG A point | Fable 5.1 | xhigh | 약 175k tokens | 약 54.0% passed"}]}
{"id":"c50","kind":"derived","text":"실패 종류 그림은 Fable 5.1 low 를 370번 중 140번(37.8%) 통과로 센다. 곡선 그림의 Fable 5.1 low 는 약 32% 다 (장 13)","verdict":"derived","scope":"FIG B 데이터의 140/370 과 FIG A 좌표 환산값","derived_from":["140","370","32.0"],"note":"37.8% 는 문서가 계산했다. 원문에는 이 비율과 두 그림의 비교가 없다","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"FIG B data","quote":"FIG B data | Fable 5.1 | effort 10 | label low | passed 140 of 370 | median 72982 tokens | missed a case 59 | made the wrong call 133 | picked the wrong reading 25"},{"source":"w1","locator":"FIG A point","quote":"FIG A point | Fable 5.1 | low | 약 64k tokens | 약 32.0% passed"}]}
{"id":"c51","kind":"web","text":"수치는 내부 실행이고 과제당 5번, Fable 5.1 은 안전 개입을 끈 채 돌렸으며 제품에서는 보안 요청 일부가 Opus 로 넘어간다. 보안 과제는 인터넷 없이 돌렸다 (장 13)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 각주 1","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§footnote 1","quote":"these come from our own internal runs, 5 attempts per task, with our production safety interventions off for Fable 5.1; in Claude products, Fable 5.1’s safeguards hand some security requests to Opus."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§footnote 1","quote":"The security tasks also ran without internet access, so the per-task counts here won’t line up with the public leaderboard or the launch post. The worked examples come from individual runs, some at intermediate effort settings."}]}
{"id":"c52","kind":"web","text":"FIG C 의 낮은 단계는 각 모델의 낮은 두 설정, 높은 단계는 높은 세 설정을 합친 값이고, Fable 5.1 은 low 와 medium 대 xhigh, effort-120, max 다 (장 8)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 FIG C 캡션과 차트 데이터","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§FIG C caption","quote":"Pass rate. Low effort pools each model's two lowest settings, top effort its three highest, since categories are small."},{"source":"w1","locator":"FIG C pooled","quote":"FIG C pooled settings | Fable 5.1 | low effort = low, medium | top effort = xhigh, 120, max"}]}
{"id":"c54","kind":"derived","text":"Opus 5.5 는 high 에서 max 까지 가면 토큰이 약 2.7배가 되고 통과율은 약 7%p 오른다 (장 6)","verdict":"derived","scope":"FIG A 좌표 환산 근삿값 103k→276k, 58.9%→65.7%","derived_from":["103","276","58.9","65.7"],"note":"원문에는 이 배수와 차이가 없다. 문서가 계산했다","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"FIG A point","quote":"FIG A point | Opus 5.5 | high | 약 103k tokens | 약 58.9% passed"},{"source":"w1","locator":"FIG A point","quote":"FIG A point | Opus 5.5 | max | 약 276k tokens | 약 65.7% passed"}]}
{"id":"c55","kind":"web","text":"API 에서 메시지 단위 effort 변경은 beta 기능이다 (장 12)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w3 첫머리와 §Per-message effort (beta)","evidence":[{"source":"w3","locator":"§Effort","quote":"The top-level effort parameter is available on all supported models with no beta header required."}]}
